 solutions, we subtract the smaller solution from the larger solution:\n\\[3 - (-9) = 3 + 9 = 12\\]\n\nTherefore, the positive difference between the solutions is \\(\\boxed{12}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{12}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"algebra:646"}
